[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_core.py: Implement semver_core interface: concrete Version data type methods and non-frozen dataclass exceptions with __str__ diagnostics
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_range.py: Implement semver_range interface: concrete VersionRange string representation and exception diagnostics
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/dependency_solver.py: Implement dependency_solver interface: data record types and poly-type protocols with exception diagnostics
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/tests/semver_core_impl_test.py: Author VersionEngine unit tests: valid parse postconditions (prerelease/build tuples, is_prerelease, format/str round-trip), InvalidVersionError for leading zeroes and grammar violations, and precedence postconditions (numeric components, tri-state, normal vs prerelease, prerelease ordering chain, build metadata ignored).
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/tests/semver_range_impl_test.py: Author RangeEngine unit tests with a mocked VersionEngine collaborator: comparator/caret/tilde/wildcard/hyphen/union parsing postconditions, whitespace trimming and operator whitespace, InvalidRangeError for bare partials and malformed syntax, and satisfies postconditions (boolean match, caret/conjunction/union expansion, prerelease filtering, explicit prerelease targeting, and unshifted prerelease inequality).
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/tests/dependency_solver_impl_test.py: Author PackageRepository and DependencySolver unit tests with mocked VersionEngine and RangeEngine collaborators: registration, descending release ordering, dependency retention, shallow-copy reads, PackageNotFoundError on missing lookups, has_package/all_packages, and resolve postconditions (highest-precedence selection, transitive resolution, backtracking to a compatible assignment, unsatisfiable conflicts, and missing-package conflicts surfacing as ResolutionConflictError).
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_core_impl.py: Implement SemVer 2.0.0 VersionEngine: regex grammar validation with InvalidVersionError, structured version parsing, and precedence comparison honoring numeric, prerelease, and build-metadata rules
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/semver_range_impl.py: Implement RangeEngine: whitespace-delimited range parsing with wildcard/caret/tilde/hyphen/union expansion and InvalidRangeError validation, plus prerelease-aware comparator satisfaction
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/semver_solver_multi/lib/dependency_solver_impl.py: Implement PackageRepository indexed descending release storage with PackageNotFoundError, and backtracking DependencySolver with MRV selection, forward checking, conflict trail, and ResolutionConflictError
